"""ComputAI - where your compute and AI money goes.

One ledger for Claude, Codex, local models, homelab machines and cloud GPUs:
tokens, GPU hours, kWh and money, side by side.

    computai                         # live dashboard (on a terminal)
    computai --summary --month       # this month's totals
    computai --line                  # "Claude 42%｜Codex 100%｜today $3.2"
    computai --web                   # dashboard for the browser and phone, plus /metrics
    computai --analyze               # cache waste, month-end forecast, plan advice
    computai --report --html r.html  # monthly report
    computai --proxy                 # count Ollama tokens (the only optional daemon)

Python 3.8+, standard library only. Remote machines only need SSH and sh.
"""

